{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, take it, check it, then move to next. If not visible, search for it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    />\"",
